# Slabhold workflow
- Test and build locally (`npm run lint`, `npm run build`). Fix failures before opening a PR.
- Never run `supabase db push` or any Supabase CLI command against production.
- If new SQL is needed, add a file under `supabase/migrations/` with a `-- UNAPPLIED` header and wait for QA review. Do not run it.
- Never call production cron endpoints (including `/api/cron/refresh-card-values`).
- Never print, paste, or commit secrets (including anything from `.env` / `.env.local`).
- Never run `next upgrade`.
- Do not run `git add -A` unless asked.
- Open a PR and don't merge.
